Source: smile2unlock
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Smile2Unlock maintainers <ation_ciger@sgxi.cn>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/Smile2Unlock/Smile2Unlock_v2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: smile2unlock
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libpam0g, libsystemd0, dbus, polkitd, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: sudo
Description: Local face authentication with desktop, sudo and Polkit integration
 Local face authentication with a desktop interface and PAM integration.
 This package uses checksum-verified upstream release binaries, private
 runtime libraries and recognition models. Configure authentication in the GUI.
